LIBERIUM HUB v91.18 — NEON GLASS UI PATCH
==========================================

This is a UI-layer replacement patch for the existing Keyless source.
It is NOT the complete 1400-line script. It preserves the existing public UI API:
Lib.new, win:AddTab, tab:AddSubTab, sub:AddSection, section:AddToggle,
section:AddSlider, section:AddButton, section:AddDropdown, Set(), Destroy().

HOW TO APPLY
------------
In Keyless, locate:
    local Win, Tab, Sub, Sec = {}, {}, {}, {}
and replace the UI library block through:
    function Sec:AddDropdown(name, opts, def, cb) return Dropdown.new(self.Frame, name, opts, def, cb) end

Keep the following ConfigManager/config code after that line unchanged.
Make a backup first. This patch changes presentation and input handling only.

DESIGN GOALS
------------
- Dark ink surfaces, restrained violet/cyan accent, subtle gradient and borders.
- Sidebar with a clear active indicator and larger mobile-friendly touch targets.
- Fixed header, brand/version status, draggable window.
- Responsive scaling based on viewport; scrolling content stays within bounds.
- Toggle state is visually clear; sliders have a larger hit target.
- Cleanup disconnects global input/camera listeners.

